Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: haltia-music
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-secret-1,
 python3-haltia-kit (>= 2.1.0), python3-mpv, python3-aiohttp, python3-aiofiles,
 python3-yarl, python3-requests, python3-typing-extensions, python3-qrcode
Description: Yandex Music with its radio, collection, charts and search
 Музыка (Music) plays Яндекс Музыка: Моя волна and its modes, one's
 collection, the chart, new releases and picks, and finds tracks and
 playlists. It signs in by a QR code or a short code, keeps playing behind
 other windows, and shows what plays in the desktop's player controls. Part
 of Haltia, a calm touch desktop; it runs on any GTK desktop.
 .
 The yandex-music and ya-passport-auth libraries, which the distribution
 lacks, come inside the package.
